[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i69"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总觉得没睡好。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“姆～啾～啾～啾～啾～♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回家后就进被窝睡觉，那首歌一直在我脑袋里循环。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“姆～啾～啾～啾～啾～♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉好羞耻，我在被窝里翻来覆去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“姆～啾～啾～姆～啾～啾～啾～♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不行啊，这旋律出不了我的脑袋了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“姆～啾～姆～啾～姆～啾～姆～啾～♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且还变得越来越欢快了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"见到镜子阿姨后，说不定会说出姆啾。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不要一直想着紬了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对了，试着想想天善吧。"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"天善啊……"},{"op":"image","layer":3,"image":"i25679"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"心里想着那家伙，总算是平静下来了。"},{"op":"image","layer":3,"image":"i25679"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“早上好，羽依里君。”"},{"op":"image","layer":3,"image":"i25680"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11566"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“天善好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":3,"image":"i25680"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“唉？什么？是在打招呼吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对不起，刚刚在想着天善的事……”"},{"op":"image","layer":3,"image":"i25681"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“早上好，镜子阿姨。”"},{"op":"image","layer":3,"image":"i25681"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11614"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊，嗯。你们关系真好呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":3,"image":"i25682"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，还好吧……那个，我要出门了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":3,"image":"i25682"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有什么事的话，就来灯塔找我吧，我应该在那里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":3,"image":"i25682"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11566"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“原来不是去加纳那里啊……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":3},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13770"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“早上好，乳依里。今天也是准时到达啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，紬呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“还没有来。今天说不定也在和发带较劲呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“昨天唱歌的时候，明明好好的教过她了啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“但是，她也是特意为了乳依里而打扮的，稍微忍耐一下吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也是。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13785"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“好慢啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久比我更早的觉得不耐烦了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“意外的没耐心呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那是因为，连续两天这么干等着了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13825"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啾……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啾？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13794"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“等了好久紬都没有来，我就试着用紬可爱的方式来表现了一下情绪低落的样子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13775"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“怎么样？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正因为是静久，才会啾啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样也不错呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“依里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13761"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啾!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“依里～”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13746"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啾啾啾啾～！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗯。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们，真是很好的表现出了紬的风格呢。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……这有两个不得了的人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11720"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“真是厉害了，这两个人……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11721"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10254"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……被麻烦的家伙们看到了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你们来这里干什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“给，我带了新的吕客罐来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13771"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啊啦，谢谢你了♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11753"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我带来了自己吃完薯片的罐子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不好意思，并没有多少。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，麻烦你特地送来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10146"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唉，紬呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14805"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“不好意思！让你们久等了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，来了呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“啊……唉……那个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……真的是，真的是十分对不起！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有点哭出来的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“今天怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14827"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“啊，唉……睡过头了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦哦。不用太在意的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14805"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不要再摆出那么失落的表情啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“夏天结束之前，我们都要尽可能的保持微笑哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“但是……连续两天我都这样迟到了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬摆出这样的哭脸的话，不只是我，静久不也是会很失落吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13800"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啾啾～～～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14796"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14786"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“真是非常独特的失落方式呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“依里里里里里里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14749"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14753"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“好可怕。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被吓到了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14787"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“嗯……明天绝对不会再迟到了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14784"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“所以，今天也请大家多多照顾我了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“刚刚看起来像是吵起来了，稍微回避了一下……已经结束了吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“紬似乎是睡过头了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14785"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“野村，苍，你们来了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她们是带着这些东西来的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14797"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“吕客！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14812"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“两位，真是非常感谢你们！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10394"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这些就作为二位成为恋人的贺礼吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11771"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“作为贺礼送给你们，觉得怎么样？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14785"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“呀，我当然是非常高兴了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14810"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“两位……特意送吕客过来，真是非常感谢！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10112"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“下次收集一定数量后还会带过来给你的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“下次见吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人回去了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，今天做些什么呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14757"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“唉嗯……虽然有些过意不去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14739"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我有一些事情需要你们的帮助。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦，真是罕见呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14760"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“灯塔内部如今有些脏了，我想打扫一下灯塔。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这不是很好吗？三个人一起打扫卫生，很快就能做好了吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13810"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是啊，灯塔给我们提供了这么多照顾，我们一起打扫干净吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14811"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“哦～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是，那两人的穿着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗯。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没有运动衫之类的衣服吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14779"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“没有啊，怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是，上衣是低胸的，裙子也很短，弯下腰来，那个，就能看到谷间了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那种小事，完全不用在意吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唉，我还是相当在意的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看到裙内的风景之类的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13837"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那，那就是……大问题了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来这方面还是很在意的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14760"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“既然如此，就穿那个吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……？"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i137"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14692"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那么，我就去打扫这边了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14066"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我打扫这边♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"猫猫和牛牛在打扫灯塔。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是在报恩吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样的话确实看不到谷间和裙内风景了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，我就打扫这边了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14649"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“羽依里先生，请使用这个打扫。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白色的水？这是什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14637"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是淘米水哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14651"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“木制部分呀，木地板呀用淘米水擦拭之后就会有光泽感，变得很干净。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是这样啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14109"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“老奶奶的乳惠袋呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是智慧袋。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14602"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这个做完之后，接着拜托你打扫一下卧室。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14080"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“紬刚刚是不是说了巨乳室？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“才没有说。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14690"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“～～～♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14083"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啊，就这样边做扫除，边试着想歌词怎么样呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14630"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“哦，那样也不错呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“活动活动身体，好像更容易想出合适的词汇。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“话说回来，还真是多啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬的布偶朋友有密密麻麻一整片。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14661"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“羽依里先生，要不要我送你个朋友？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不需要。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14602"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“但是，我回去之后，你可能会感到孤单……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14570"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“请收下吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14661"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“静久也是，也给你一个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14126"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“也好……那就收下一个吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我非常推荐这个宇宙人哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“给牛牛那个布偶吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14129"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“内脏会被宇宙人给挖掉的哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14680"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“鹫尾才不会做那种事呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"名字还挺古朴的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14602"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“如果这里有你们喜欢的，就尽管带回去吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14107"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我很喜欢的啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14104"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14135"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“既然这么说的话，那我肯定喜欢的是紬呀。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14619"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆喵!؟”"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i321"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14673"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14116"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“抱～～～～～♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么我也选紬。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14127"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆喵！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抱――――！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14684"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“你，你们俩别这样，喘不过气了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14136"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我要带着你回家～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，要带这只猫咪回家的是我。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14686"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14116"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆喵！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14688"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我要被羽依里先生带回家了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14114"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀呀。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14136"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那样的话，牛牛要不也一块带回去？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这就要考虑一下了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14130"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“唉!؟”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i137"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久肯定也在考虑着同样的事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬已经开始在说关于自己回去之后的事了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"灯塔开始变得干净了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总觉得怎么说呢……令人感觉无比寂寞。"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i321"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14684"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14116"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯哼～～～～～♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14691"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14136"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“静久，你太粘着我了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14662"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这样的话就没法打扫了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就保持这样，粘在一块打扫好了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14666"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14114"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀，好啊♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14673"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14116"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"三个人粘在一块擦拭墙壁。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬啊，你回去之后会不会觉得寂寞？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14664"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14114"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“羽依里先生。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14678"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“你这就叫做愚蠢的问题。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14670"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“会的。毫无疑问会。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，为了不让紬回去之后感到寂寞，我也送给你一个朋友好了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14657"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“久违地离开一次这座岛，去一次布偶专卖店，送紬喜欢的布偶作为礼物吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14583"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“离开……这座岛吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊。虽然我也没有去过专卖店。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14119"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那么我带你们去吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“静久对布偶专卖店很熟悉吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14116"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“也算不上很熟悉啦，只是亲戚中有非常喜欢布偶的人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14125"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“能帮忙介绍从世界各处进货的布偶店。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14693"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“哦～……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14114"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬没有去过那样的店吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14707"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14699"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“似乎在来这座岛之前……似乎有过一次这样的经历。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14691"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“但是，那是在我懂事之前的事了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“去过是去过了吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14603"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“自从来了这座小岛后，就再也没有出去过了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，久违的离开这里一次怎么样？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14583"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“可，可以吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，我们来决定日子吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14116"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“顺便，一起去吃好吃的东西怎么样？我也想久违地吃一次甜食了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“行啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14673"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这岛上也有很多好吃的食物呀……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14138"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“岛外美食有着不一样的美味哦，特别是甜食。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“大概吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14136"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“对了！你们两位一定要买泳衣哦！以后我们三人一起游泳吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，这次我也陪着你们去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14125"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“而且……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i137"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“静久，停一下！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样一直提出想法的话，就没法在一天内全部做完了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14672"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14113"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀，这不是很好吗。乳依里没有想法吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，要这么说的话当然有想法。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“目前为止我们聊到的，全部是女性向活动，作为男生――”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――想要去的地方，想做的事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想法不断的涌现。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“呜哇……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14570"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“听起来能玩的非常开心呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那么，我们要先去什么地方呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14690"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“首先去布偶店，我要找到和羽依里先生一模一样的布偶！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那估计是没有……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14659"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“也要找到和静久一摸一样的布偶。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14135"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀，谢谢♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14661"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“～～～♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14113"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“呵呵，看来心情很好啊♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么时候去呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14570"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“现在就出发吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14107"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“会不会太着急了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而且灯塔才打扫到一半，要放着不管吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那么，明天怎么样？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14113"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯……感觉今天明天都有些太着急了，要不就后天吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“行啊，我赞成。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14692"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“唉嘿嘿♪……真是太让人期待了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14690"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那么就约好了哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14735"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“一起来拉钩吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我还有点分不清哪个是小拇指。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14727"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“用你喜欢的爪子好了，没关系的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是这样吗？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i321"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14728"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14116"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"爪子和手贴在一起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有点不像拉钩起誓。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"倒是像社团活动时组成的圆阵。"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“拉钩～拉钩～，说谎～要吃～千根针～♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“像是歌词一样唱出来了呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14730"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我们拉钩咯♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14114"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“唱出来了啊。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i137"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14729"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14113"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14605"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“后天，我非常期待♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14135"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我也是♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也是哦。既然已经拉过钩了，那就一定要去。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然是有点遗憾的拉钩。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14665"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14113"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“唉，要不继续考虑后续的歌词怎么样？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，正好也说到歌词了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“～～～♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14661"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“～～～♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i321"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14693"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哼唱着开心时才会哼的旋律。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样就连现在的寂寥心情，也会变得开心起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"带着这样的期待，哼唱那首曲子。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i740"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬回去的日子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那张照片。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有些事依然令人不安。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就像即使无法下水，也依然喜欢游泳一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就像即使很快就要分别，也和紬成为了恋人一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"人总要与这种这种难以忽视的，难过悲伤的感情相伴度过一生。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和紬在一起，我领悟到了这件事。"},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]